<item><title>Oggi 0.3.22</title><sparkle:version>27</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.22</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>Personal dot now explains why syncing from this Mac paused. If Keychain cannot save the login before renewal starts, unlock your Mac and click Connect to retry.</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/mattedwrds/oggi-downloads/releases/download/v0.3.22/Oggi-0.3.22-macOS.zip" length="4178229" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="boMF0+HtlVIq0AKzdawFpcWZtiRxOP/MjU4I1EIV5AgaCZNo52TC+MVCf4nrwpMGw6LCfLXqr7LFtkVXtl7aBQ=="></enclosure></item><item><title>Oggi 0.3.21</title><sparkle:version>26</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.21</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>Oggi now resumes syncing your shared list when the app opens with a saved connection. Personal dot shows when the server last received your list, including after a few days away. Privacy changes take effect on the server when Oggi syncs.</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/mattedwrds/oggi-downloads/releases/download/v0.3.21/Oggi-0.3.21-macOS.zip" length="4175715" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Aegaavk2Jeb1XNbnPfS9OGJRwMTeR4FsFcogihQSrnTLw9E9Bqj4E3hc50O/Pb6Bixpfms4PElvcqwo2OKOeDw=="></enclosure></item><item><title>Oggi 0.3.20</title><sparkle:version>25</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.20</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>The collapsed sidebar keeps the same window when the pointer approaches. Card dragging reuses measured positions and updates the moving rows directly. The Doing Now card has a larger title, more space for wrapping, and a softer flame behind the text.</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/mattedwrds/oggi-downloads/releases/download/v0.3.20/Oggi-0.3.20-macOS.zip" length="4170320" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="7fxaf4HnOpNCuBwM52emqSe3QjeiV/yXRFDYMO9ttS4TmNyu2JJs02osga786N0QMNxPxN9qD6g/jcnSHw/pDg=="></enclosure></item><item><title>Oggi 0.3.19</title><sparkle:version>24</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.19</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>More efficient flame rendering, drag tasks by their cards, task-card fracture completion, and a cohesive paper/plum treatment with clearer controls.</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/mattedwrds/oggi-downloads/releases/download/v0.3.19/Oggi-0.3.19-macOS.zip" length="4165554" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="XRDFcTNLQCy71Cr6ZhiKFTswe0uXp+uqQHcdtd5SZbB5Ohg3SMQGGYqmSTZDp5EQBl4b9Y939qhgquc66KdHCA=="></enclosure></item><item><title>Oggi 0.3.18</title><sparkle:version>23</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.18</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>Native motion update: living focus and sidebar flames, weighted task swaps, and responsive panel docking. Gentle edge placement stays open; deliberate pushes collapse. Includes keyboard movement and reduced-motion support.</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/mattedwrds/oggi-downloads/releases/download/v0.3.18/Oggi-0.3.18-macOS.zip" length="4094778" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="9wn4ywIM30hwHGD67wRxQfbF3vf8HclfQxntQnFSdGR07ReEeZseb72slViiyVb3DjOu+NIkIbroFAriFwuUCg=="></enclosure></item><item><title>Oggi 0.3.17</title><sparkle:version>22</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.17</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>Optional dot task management: explicitly allow adding, renaming, reordering, completing and reopening local shared tasks. Changes apply once on your Mac with Undo; private, paused and linked Reminders stay protected.</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/mattedwrds/oggi-downloads/releases/download/v0.3.17/Oggi-0.3.17-macOS.zip" length="3817727" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="y6L+teTXjxEZybqYoZBhs/P1BQnCqLpbCn7SURXNGY0yYQvBWGcb6C5zwV/QFMHzrolqZ1Wczm3eZQgtoNslDg=="></enclosure></item><item><title>Oggi 0.3.16</title><sparkle:version>21</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.16</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>Compact dot-help controls with accessible status and scrollable suggestions. Offline checks before credential refresh reduce unnecessary recovery while preserving safe handling of uncertain requests.</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/mattedwrds/oggi-downloads/releases/download/v0.3.16/Oggi-0.3.16-macOS.zip" length="3430903" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="SpltWxoyA4XeTB0VlbYMqL8jVXsP+QxUo2KmfBUgud2yaKxcPsbPJi2aRhNNief3aHs2eNG5N0KJrdcbBVoMBQ=="></enclosure></item><item><title>Oggi 0.3.15</title><sparkle:version>20</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.15</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>Clearer Add and Add at top controls, a single rounded task selection, Command-Z for tasks and text editing, and a tidier menu button.</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/mattedwrds/oggi-downloads/releases/download/v0.3.15/Oggi-0.3.15-macOS.zip" length="3363125" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="y9tBfwPh85i9dcZHS3XPfSm269EMqxCfh3bFcNyEEioux+LzSppRq+WgEXuNYwxaX4s7G+ojS4e3xZfE2pWDCA=="></enclosure></item><item><title>Oggi 0.3.14</title><sparkle:version>19</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.14</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>Optional read-only list sharing with your connected dot, current order and Doing now, last-sync status, and per-task privacy controls. Sharing starts off.</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/mattedwrds/oggi-downloads/releases/download/v0.3.14/Oggi-0.3.14-macOS.zip" length="3340199" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Qn0cZxJ1FHV4VRNz9goDSGHZn4gz8fd53/aHpXUqM7ANNSfAI+eT6s3Yo3OFsC5OenDmm34qmRNkf5xgbx4gDw=="></enclosure></item><item><title>Oggi 0.3.13</title><sparkle:version>18</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.13</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>Retries temporary connection outages automatically without resetting dot access. Clarifies dot reconnection and confirms recovery before resetting access.</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/mattedwrds/oggi-downloads/releases/download/v0.3.13/Oggi-0.3.13-macOS.zip" length="3228793" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="IpRplCuxX9wVRnH1SrU1/I5qQsa+qsj5oPDwXbrL4LfGO/mJhe3ZmXn8Q5R70UC97PH6DyQ1ZF+IS6dFrvLuAw=="></enclosure></item><item><title>Oggi 0.3.12</title><sparkle:version>17</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.12</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>Selected rows and keyboard ordering, add at top, explicit task deletion, completed-task grouping and improved edge-tab positioning.</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/mattedwrds/oggi-downloads/releases/download/v0.3.12/Oggi-0.3.12-macOS.zip" length="3220684" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="doE4GjBDidjtHiXWbowejfn71IIR8XGRC2Y9KKKmgv30bZtIl/Ck+yAxa5fOkZ5oDzH/tNGZeiQfqLbNAXOdCQ=="></enclosure></item><item><title>Oggi 0.3.11</title><sparkle:version>16</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.11</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>Fixes Personal dot Connect failing before the sign-in browser opens. Preserves tasks and saved connection settings.</description><enclosure url